  <h3 style="margin-top:36px">How to Reach Poornima University</h3>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ic">✈ &nbsp;By Air</div>
      <p>Jaipur International Airport (JAI), Sanganer, is approximately 15 km (25 minutes) from the campus, with direct flights from all major Indian cities and select international destinations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ic">🚆 &nbsp;By Train</div>
      <p>Durgapura railway station (DPA) is approximately 15 km from campus; the main Jaipur Junction (JP) is about 25 km. Jaipur is well connected to the national rail network.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="ic">🚗 &nbsp;By Road</div>
      <p>Accessible via the Delhi–Mumbai Expressway and NH-48. Sindhi Camp is the principal inter-state bus terminal; prepaid taxis and app-based cabs are available from all transit hubs.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top:36px">Accommodation</h3>
  <p class="lead">Paid accommodation facilities for conference participants will be available at the university and at nearby hotels and guest houses. Requirements may be indicated at the time of registration.</p>
